msgstr "Yanayin faɗakarwar Doctor ba daidai yake ba. Maido da doctor_alert_pending daga ajiyar baya kafin a sake gwadawa."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Doctor alert transitions are invalid; no email was sent."
msgstr "Canje-canjen yanayin faɗakarwar Doctor ba daidai suke ba; ba a aika imel ba."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Alert delivery"
msgstr "Isar da faɗakarwa"

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d check transitions await delivery; attempts: %d of 3."
msgstr "Canje-canjen bincike %d suna jiran isarwa; yunƙuri: %d cikin 3."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Automatic retries exhausted. Correct Cacti mail settings, then run Doctor with --scheduled --retry-alerts as the poller user."
msgstr "Yunƙurin gwaji na atomatik ya ƙare. Gyara saitunan imel na Cacti, sannan ka gudanar da Doctor da --scheduled --retry-alerts a matsayin mai amfani na poller."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "Next eligible retry: %s UTC, after a primary poller cycle."
msgstr "Sake gwadawa na gaba da ya cancanta: %s UTC, bayan zagayen babban poller."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "No alert recipients are currently configured; pending transitions are retained."
msgstr "Ba a saita masu karɓar faɗakarwa a halin yanzu ba; ana riƙe canje-canjen yanayi da ke jira."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "No retained alert is awaiting delivery. Mail-server acceptance does not prove inbox delivery."
msgstr "Babu faɗakarwar da aka riƙe da ke jiran isarwa. Karɓa daga uwar garken imel ba ta tabbatar da isowa akwatin saƙo ba."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Doctor retained status changes (UTC). Repeated changes for one check are coalesced; an out-and-back transition is retained."
msgstr "Canje-canjen matsayi da Doctor ya riƙe (UTC). Canje-canjen da aka maimaita ga bincike guda ana haɗe su; canjin fita-da-dawowa ana riƙe shi."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s: %s -> %s (latest change %s)"
msgstr "%s: %s -> %s (canjin ƙarshe %s)"

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d further status changes are not listed because the alert queue reached its storage limit."
msgstr "Ba a jero ƙarin canje-canjen matsayi %d ba saboda layin faɗakarwa ya kai iyakar ma'ajiyarsa."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Open Utilities > Doctor for current measurements, recommended actions, and verification steps."
msgstr "Buɗe Utilities > Doctor don ma'aunai na yanzu, matakan da aka ba da shawara, da matakan tantancewa."

#: doctor_scheduling.php
#, php-format
msgid "Cacti Doctor: %d retained status changes"
msgstr "Cacti Doctor: canje-canjen matsayi %d da aka riƙe"

#: doctor_scheduling.php
msgid "Doctor schedule is already running or the database lock is unavailable."
msgstr "Tsarin lokacin Doctor yana gudana tuni ko kuma makullin rumbun bayanai ba ya samuwa."

#: doctor_web.php
msgid "The finding could not be acknowledged. Run Doctor again, then acknowledge the current result."
msgstr "Ba a iya tabbatar da ganin sakamakon binciken ba. Sake gudanar da Doctor, sannan ka tabbatar da sakamakon na yanzu."

#: doctor_web.php
msgid "The warning exception could not be saved. Use a fresh assessed warning, an owner, a reason and an expiry within 90 days."
msgstr "Ba a iya ajiye keɓancewar gargaɗi ba. Yi amfani da sabon gargaɗin da aka tantance, mai mallaka, dalili da ranar ƙarewa cikin kwanaki 90."

#: doctor_web.php
msgid "Confirm repair"
msgstr "Tabbatar da gyara"

#: doctor_web.php
msgid "Approval expires after five minutes and is invalidated by a changed filesystem. The acting account must be able to create directories or change owner permissions."
msgstr "Amincewar tana ƙarewa bayan mintuna biyar kuma canjin tsarin fayiloli yana soke ta. Dole ne asusun da ke aiki ya iya ƙirƙirar manyan fayiloli ko canza izinan mai mallaka."

#: doctor_web.php
msgid "Repair prerequisites are not met. No changes will be made."
msgstr "Ba a cika sharuɗɗan farko na gyara ba. Ba za a yi wani sauyi ba."

#: doctor_web.php
