msgstr "Gudanar da Bincike a kan Jadawali"

#: setup.php
msgid "Run every Doctor check in the background after the poller and record each check's status."
msgstr "Gudanar da kowane binciken Doctor a ɓoye bayan poller kuma a ajiye matsayin kowane bincike."

#: setup.php
msgid "Check Interval"
msgstr "Tazarar Bincike"

#: setup.php
msgid "How often the scheduled checks run."
msgstr "Yawan lokacin da bincike masu tsari suke gudana."

#: setup.php
msgid "Every 15 Minutes"
msgstr "Kowane Minti 15"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Hour"
msgstr "Kowace Awa"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every 6 Hours"
msgstr "Kowace Awa 6"

#: setup.php
msgid "Every Day"
msgstr "Kowace Rana"

#: setup.php
msgid "Alert Email Addresses"
msgstr "Adiresoshin Imel na Faɗakarwa"

#: setup.php
msgid "Comma-separated addresses to email when a check starts or stops failing. Leave empty to only log changes to the Cacti log."
msgstr "Adiresoshi da aka raba da waƙafi don aika imel idan bincike ya fara ko ya daina kasawa. Bar shi fanko don rubuta canje-canje a rajistar Cacti kawai."

#: setup.php
msgid "Alert on Warnings"
msgstr "Faɗakarwa kan Gargaɗi"

#: setup.php
msgid "Also alert when a check moves into or out of a warning."
msgstr "Haka ma a faɗakar idan bincike ya shiga ko ya fita daga yanayin gargaɗi."

#: setup.php
msgid "Thresholds"
msgstr "Iyakokin Ma'auni"

#: setup.php
msgid "Poller Run Time Warning (percent)"
msgstr "Gargaɗin Lokacin Gudanar da Poller (kashi cikin ɗari)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the last main-poller run used this share of the polling interval. Runs that take the whole interval always fail."
msgstr "Yi gargaɗi idan gudanarwar main-poller ta ƙarshe ta yi amfani da wannan kason tazarar bincike. Gudanarwar da ta ɗauki dukan tazarar koyaushe tana kasa."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRA Disk Free Warning (percent)"
msgstr "Gargaɗin Sararin Faifai na RRA (kashi cikin ɗari)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when free space on the RRA file system drops below this percentage."
msgstr "Yi gargaɗi idan sararin da ya rage a tsarin fayil na RRA ya sauka ƙasa da wannan kashi cikin ɗari."

#: setup.php
msgid "Fail when free space on the RRA file system drops below this percentage."
msgstr "Kasa idan sararin da ya rage a tsarin fayil na RRA ya sauka ƙasa da wannan kashi cikin ɗari."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRA Disk Free Failure (percent)"
msgstr "Gazawar Sararin Faifai na RRA (kashi cikin ɗari)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Clock Drift Warning (seconds)"
msgstr "Gargaɗin Bambancin Agogo (daƙiƙoƙi)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the database and PHP clocks differ by more than this."
msgstr "Yi gargaɗi idan agogon rumbun bayanai da na PHP suka bambanta da fiye da wannan."

#: setup.php
msgid "Clock Drift Failure (seconds)"
msgstr "Gazawar Bambancin Agogo (daƙiƙoƙi)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Fail when the database and PHP clocks differ by more than this."
msgstr "Kasa idan agogon rumbun bayanai da na PHP suka bambanta da fiye da wannan."

#: setup.php
msgid "RRD Stale Intervals"
msgstr "Tazarorin RRD Marasa Sabuntawa"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn after this many collection intervals without a file update (1 to 100)."
msgstr "Yi gargaɗi bayan waɗannan tazarorin tattara bayanai ba tare da sabunta fayil ba (1 zuwa 100)."

#: setup.php
msgid "Additional disk-write delay for external caching (0 to 86400). Boost adds its own allowance."
msgstr "Ƙarin jinkirin rubutawa a faifai don ajiyar waje (0 zuwa 86400). Boost yana ƙara nasa rangwamen."

#: setup.php
msgid "Deferred RRD Write Allowance (seconds)"
msgstr "Rangwamen Jinkirin Rubutun RRD (daƙiƙoƙi)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Cacti Log Size Warning (MB)"
msgstr "Gargaɗin Girman Rajistar Cacti (MB)"

#: setup.php
msgid "Warn when the Cacti log grows beyond this size, which usually means log rotation is not running."
msgstr "Yi gargaɗi idan rajistar Cacti ta wuce wannan girman, wanda yawanci ke nufin juya rajista (log rotation) ba ya aiki."
